  "notes": "COMPOSITION:\n{一|いち} (one) + {礼|れい} (bow, courtesy). Literally \"one bow.\"\n\nGRAMMAR:\n{一礼|いちれい}する is used as a する verb meaning \"to bow once\" or \"to give a bow.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {一礼|いちれい}する (to bow)\n- {軽|かる}く{一礼|いちれい}する (to give a slight bow)\n- {深|ふか}く{一礼|いちれい}する (to bow deeply)\n- {丁寧|ていねい}に{一礼|いちれい}する (to bow politely)",
